    {
      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "d51078eebc76543e845fa964fff9acee",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"a-triangle-with-a-loop-momentum-numerator\">A triangle with a loop-momentum numerator</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Let <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(r_0=0||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(r_1=q_1||)</marimo-tex>, and <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(r_2=q_1+q_2||)</marimo-tex>. The denominators are\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(D_i=(k+r_i)^2-m^2+i0||)</marimo-tex>, and the numerator is <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(k\\cdot q_1||)</marimo-tex>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Declare <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(q_1^2=p_1^2||)</marimo-tex>, <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(q_2^2=p_2^2||)</marimo-tex>, and\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(q_1\\cdot q_2=(s-p_1^2-p_2^2)/2||)</marimo-tex> in <code>hep.Kinematics</code>.\nBuild the three denominator expressions with <code>scalar_product</code>; the reducer\nderives the masses and master invariants from this shared family.\nThe output master is\n<code>C0(p1sq, p2sq, s, mass2, mass2, mass2, mu2)</code>.\nThe <strong>last argument is always the squared renormalization scale</strong>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Keep the dimension symbolic: <code>Kinematics(D, ...)</code> retains the dependence\nneeded for <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(D=4-2\\epsilon||)</marimo-tex>. The explicit powers <code>[1, 1, 1]</code> specify this\nintegral; zero powers pinch propagators, and negative powers put them in\nthe numerator. The same family can also be passed to <code>hep.IBPFamily</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "508795d46d420af8b16951700445d97c",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Shared Feynkit family, also accepted by <code>hep.IBPFamily</code></strong></span></span><section class=\"feynkit-integral-family\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><style>.feynkit-integral-family > .feynkit-family-metadata > div { display:inline; }</style><strong>Integral family</strong><div class=\"feynkit-family-metadata\"><strong>Loop momenta:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">k</div></div><div class=\"feynkit-family-metadata\"><strong>External momenta:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">q1</div>, <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">q2</div></div><div class=\"feynkit-family-metadata\"><strong>Dimension:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">D</div></div><div>Rank: 3 / 3 &middot; complete &middot; independent</div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:.4rem\"><caption style=\"text-align:left\">Ordered inverse propagators (3)</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>1</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-mass2<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>2</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-mass2<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>p1sq<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>2\u00b7dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,q1<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>3</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-mass2<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>s<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>2\u00b7dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,q1<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>2\u00b7dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>k<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,q2<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></section><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Reduced expression in primitive OneLoopMaster symbols</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-1/2\u00b7p1sq\u00b7C0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>p1sq,p2sq,s,mass2,mass2,mass2,mu2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>1/2\u00b7B0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>p2sq,mass2,mass2,mu2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/2\u00b7B0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>s,mass2,mass2,mu2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Coefficient \u00d7 scalar master</strong></span></span><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-1/2\u00b7p1sq</div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">C0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>p1sq,p2sq,s,mass2,mass2,mass2,mu2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/2</div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">B0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>s,mass2,mass2,mu2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: row;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-1/2</div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">B0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>p2sq,mass2,mass2,mu2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div></div>"
          }
